% ============================================================================
% cloud-signal.query — worked recall queries against cloud-signal.adj
% (adj-facts-stdlib, METEOROLOGY).
% ============================================================================
% Three queries: forward recall (multiple answers) with citation, backward
% recall (bind a signal, find the cloud type), and honest abstention on
% cumulonimbus (this table only grounds the two cloud types whose cited span
% lists more than one weather signal).
% ============================================================================

import "cloud-signal.adj"

% Forward: what signals does the cited NWS sentence list for stratus clouds?
? cloud_signal(stratus, $Signal)

% Backward: which cloud type signals an upper-level jet streak?
? cloud_signal($Cloud, upper_level_jet_streak)

% Honest abstention: cumulonimbus's cited span names only one signal, no listed alternatives.
? cloud_signal(cumulonimbus, $SignalCumulonimbus)
